        <mxCell id="v0iwyNT79lTlcmo5SKfG-271" value="update change logs/versioning to maintain record of changes" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="7287" y="-3056" width="202" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;main highlights&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;1. File changes: it&#39;s crucial to track file changes, in order to keep track of the project context in real time for read and update operations. So, after every file change, document DB is updated and embeddingss are also updated(batch processing)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;2. About the debugger feature, it&#39;s good to store the error stacktrace at file level, in the document DB. So that we can track what kind of errors generally happen in that file. When a similar error occurs again, it can produce a better context for the LLM&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 36px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3. DB roles and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" placeholders="1" name="Variable" id="v0iwyNT79lTlcmo5SKfG-282">
