        <mxCell id="v0iwyNT79lTlcmo5SKfG-370" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Why text based context is not good enough:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;does not track deeply nested relationship between functional components&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;slow and expensive to track updates in the code e.g. if you change a variable name, it&#39;s difficult to track all other places where it has been used&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;text is unstructured, so LLM finds it difficult to understand it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The solution is to store the file content as Abstract syntax tree. Here&#39;s why:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Code as Graph Structure&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Each method/variable/function call&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;is a node&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Parent&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-child relationships are explicit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;References&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;are direct links&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scope&amp;nbsp;boundaries are clear&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Quick traversal&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Follow node connections&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Track symbol usage&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Navigate scope chains&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Find all references&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Structured for Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Type information preserved&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scope clearly defined&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dependencies mapped&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Query builder&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;uses intent-based routing and build queries for the document DB and for the vector DB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-left: 24px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 2px !important; margin-top: 2px !important;&quot; data-indent=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;AMA queries use project-wide&amp;nbsp;context&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-left: 24px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 2px !important; margin-top: 2px !important;&quot; data-indent=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;Debug&amp;nbsp;queries focus on error patterns&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-left: 24px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 2px !important; margin-top: 2px !important;&quot; data-indent=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;File&amp;nbsp;queries uses file based context&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-left: 24px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 2px !important; margin-top: 2px !important;&quot; data-indent=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;Documentation&amp;nbsp;queries prioritize sample project code and examples&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sample queries&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(216, 222, 233); background-color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; line-height: 18px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(109, 109, 109); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;// 1. Find implementation of a function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(239, 176, 128);&quot;&gt;findOne&lt;/span&gt;({&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;symbols.declarations&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;        &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;$elemMatch:&lt;/span&gt; {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;            &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;name:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;AuthService&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;            &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;type:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;class&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;        }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;    }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;})&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(109, 109, 109); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;// 2. Find References of a function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(239, 176, 128);&quot;&gt;find&lt;/span&gt;({&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;ast.body.data.name&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;AuthService&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;ast.body.type&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;Identifier&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;})&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(109, 109, 109); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;// 3. Find Dependencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(239, 176, 128);&quot;&gt;find&lt;/span&gt;({&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;$or:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;        { &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;relationships.imports&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(148, 193, 250);&quot;&gt;targetFile&lt;/span&gt; },&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;        { &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(227, 148, 220);&quot;&gt;&quot;relationships.importedBy&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(148, 193, 250);&quot;&gt;targetFile&lt;/span&gt; }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 214, 221);&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;})&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;div&gt;Different sets of queries give rise to different ways in which the Copilot can be used. If a new use case is to be added, you only need to add a query for that, and it will be done.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;write operations are done in a fault tolerant way. At all times, we must have:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Diff generation and preview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;User approval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;workflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Atomic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;changes with rollback&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Validation before&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Change impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Storage&amp;nbsp;optimization for different query type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;nested&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Code&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;stored with AST an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;d relationships&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Errors&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;stored with solutions and patterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Documentation stored with semantic chunks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Embeddings stored for&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;similarity search&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Metadata store&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;d for quick lookups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;section style=&quot;border-radius: 4px; margin: 6px 0px; position: relative; scroll-margin-bottom: 40px; scroll-margin-top: 40px; color: rgb(216, 222, 233); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(20, 20, 20);&quot; id=&quot;markdown-section--10&quot; class=&quot;markdown-section&quot; data-markdown-raw=&quot;8. Fault tolerance and recovery&lt;br/&gt;   - Fallback strategies for DB failures&lt;br/&gt;   - Cache mechanisms for quick access&lt;br/&gt;   - Partial context assembly&lt;br/&gt;   - Error recovery procedures&lt;br/&gt;   - Data consistency checks&quot; data-section-index=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;section style=&quot;border-radius: 4px; margin: 6px 0px; position: relative; scroll-margin-bottom: 40px; scroll-margin-top: 40px; color: rgb(216, 222, 233); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(20, 20, 20);&quot; id=&quot;markdown-section--9&quot; class=&quot;markdown-section&quot; data-markdown-raw=&quot;7. Storage optimization for different query types&lt;br/&gt;   - Code stored with AST and relationships&lt;br/&gt;   - Errors stored with solutions and patterns&lt;br/&gt;   - Documentation stored with semantic chunks&lt;br/&gt;   - Embeddings stored for similarity search&lt;br/&gt;   - Metadata stored for quick lookups&quot; data-section-index=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1256" y="-3443" width="476" height="1105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;1. fault tolerance and handling error cases&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;2. monitoring&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;3. token optimisations&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;4. performance optimisation for retrieval&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;a. cache&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;b. DB indexes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;c. batch processing embeddings for file updates&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;d.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" placeholders="1" name="Variable" id="v0iwyNT79lTlcmo5SKfG-377">
